### 공연 생성 (ADMIN-01)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/shows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "공연 이름",
  "seatCount": 100,
  "bookingOpenAt": "2026-09-25T20:00:00",
  "schedules": ["2026-10-01T19:00:00", "2026-10-02T19:00:00"]
}

### 공연 수정 (ADMIN-02)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/shows/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "수정된 공연 이름",
  "seatCount": 120,
  "bookingOpenAt": "2026-09-26T20:00:00"
}